  "description": "The native payload for Agora's content moderation extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_iOS 4.6.2 archive and packaged for .NET for iOS. Samples the outgoing video and classifies it on-device, for apps that must moderate what their users broadcast. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.iOS or Net.Agora.Voice.iOS — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraRtcEngineKit.EnableContentInspect in the RTC binding.",
